                                    <i class="fas fa-tasks card-icon" style="color:#685FD4"></i>
                                </div>
                                <p>We have successfully completed over 50 projects, delivering quality solutions.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-wrapper">
                                <div class="icon-container" style="background-color: #faebc2;">
                                    <i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt card-icon" style="color:#F2C94C"></i>
                                </div>
                                <p>Our services reach clients in more than 20 countries worldwide.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-wrapper">
                                <div class="icon-container" style="background-color: #d7e5f8;">
                                    <i class="fas fa-star card-icon" style="color:#8AB2DC"></i>
                                </div>
                                <p>We maintain a 95% client satisfaction rate through our dedication to excellence.</p>
                            </div>
